3 | (deftype (doubled-item item) (rust "Pair<{item}>"))
  |                                    ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ `deftype` templates name their parameters by number
  |
  = help: write the placeholder as `{0}`
  = note: run `knave doc L0222` for an explanation

